Package: readagau
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Australian Agricultural Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com")
Description: Discovers, caches, parses and compares versioned Australian
 agricultural time-series releases published by the Australian Bureau of
 Agricultural and Resource Economics and Sciences (ABARES)
 <https://www.agriculture.gov.au/abares>. It is intended
 for analysts and researchers who need reproducible local workflows: source
 assets can be read from local paths or downloaded to a managed cache, and
 returned tibbles retain release, table, provider, source URL, content-hash,
 and parser-version provenance. Readers can inspect catalogues, validate
 observation contracts, and compare forecast vintages and revisions. Support
 is limited to the documented release catalogue and source formats; network
 access and Poppler are optional and are required only for workflows that use
 remote sources or PDF reports.
